  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Disaster Tides — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>You are born with a great power, with great possibilities, and astounding potential, water manipulation.</p></blockquote><p>Starting at 1st level you have the ability of hydrokinesis. You can cast the <em>Shape Water cantrip</em>. You can spend 1 Cursed Energy as an action to roll a ranged cursed energy attack roll against a target within 80 feet, dealing 2d8 cold damage on a hit. This feature’s damage increases by 1d8 when you reach 5th level (3d8), 11th level (4d8), and 18th level (5d8).</p>",
